Comment: 0,0:12:15.55,0:12:21.64,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:28.64,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.89,0:01:44.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Operation Odessa ended in\Nvictory for the Earth Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.13,0:01:48.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As a result, the Zeon forces\Nwere driven back from Europe...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.47,0:01:51.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And now the war was\Nproceeding in a new direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.04,0:02:06.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready, Gunperry?\NDocking searcher, 5, 4, 3...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.81,0:02:08.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go ahead with the B Parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.49,0:02:12.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Core change! Docking, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.77,0:02:28.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.40,0:02:31.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You still haven't broken\Nthe 17 second mark in docking!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.56,0:02:33.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're asking the impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.27,0:02:37.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Core Fighter was meant to be\Nan escape capsule for the Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.37,0:02:39.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's quick to get out, but not to get back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.54,0:02:42.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It may seem impossible,\Nbut Amuro can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.80,0:02:50.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The White Base is headed for a Federation\Nsupply base in Northern Ireland...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.41,0:02:54.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...to repair damage incurred at\Nthe battle for Odessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.12,0:02:57.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, I finally have a chance to cut loose\Nand relax for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.04,0:02:58.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.45,0:02:58.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.82,0:03:02.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our destination is\Na Federation Forces dock, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.57,0:03:05.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It means we're officially part of the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.90,0:03:09.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who knows what we may be\Nordered to do from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.43,0:03:11.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.36,0:03:12.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That certainly took the fun out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.37,0:03:51.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never seen that type of warship before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.13,0:04:04.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unknown warship entering Dock 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.01,0:04:05.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Type unclear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:35.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir. We've been contacted by No. 107.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.87,0:04:39.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'd better inform the captain about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.03,0:04:58.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have a report from No. 107...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.88,0:05:01.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...that a large warship has entered SR4.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:05.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This picture is useless.\NThere's just too much radio interference.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.89,0:05:06.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:10.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm. I can't make it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.32,0:05:12.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't Boone's team\Nstationed in this area?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.19,0:05:13.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.37,0:05:15.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get the Sealance ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.11,0:05:17.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As soon as we've checked the surface,\Nbring up the Mad Angler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.10,0:05:30.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You could just order\NBoone to deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.13,0:05:34.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, if it's the Trojan Horse,\NI'd like to see for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.25,0:05:37.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lady Kycilia would laugh,\Nbut I too have my pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.86,0:05:40.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood, sir.\NThe Mad Angler will be waiting right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.74,0:05:43.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Mulligan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:57.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I came across the Trojan Horse right after\Nmy transfer to the Mad Angler squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.71,0:05:59.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am a fortunate man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.34,0:06:08.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The latest report says the external repairs\Nshould be done by tomorrow, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.01,0:06:09.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.27,0:06:13.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I do wish I had the luxury\Nof giving the crew a week's rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.06,0:06:16.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are they now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:18.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir! We've gathered them for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.19,0:06:20.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Hey!\N- Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.82,0:06:22.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You naughty kids! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.82,0:06:24.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh! Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.95,0:06:29.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Salute to General Revil!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:31.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Neener neener!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.62,0:06:32.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you little...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.29,0:06:34.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Salute!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.00,0:06:38.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good job. Please be seated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.30,0:06:41.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All crew, at ease!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.01,0:06:51.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know how I can thank you all\Nfor your efforts since you left Side 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.18,0:06:54.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse us, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.73,0:06:58.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After receiving temporary repairs here...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.86,0:07:01.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...you'll go to Federation headquarters\Nat Jaburo, in South America.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.86,0:07:03.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.78,0:07:05.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.57,0:07:08.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. What about people who aren't\Ninterested in joining the military?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.66,0:07:11.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are all very capable soldiers, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:15.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you decide to leave the military now,\Nwe'd have to imprison you for at least a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.21,0:07:18.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You... You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.21,0:07:20.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're forcing people who don't want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.59,0:07:24.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have all been exposed to\Nthe military's greatest secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.72,0:07:28.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Normally, we'd be required\Nto imprison you for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.89,0:07:31.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A soldier, huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.47,0:07:34.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Moving on to a more important subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.35,0:07:38.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Zeon Forces have recently\Nbecome quite active.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.94,0:07:41.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spurred on by the appearance\Nof the Gundam...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:44.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...they're devoting all their resources\Nto the mass production of mobile suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.53,0:07:45.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Show us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.15,0:07:46.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.91,0:07:50.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is still unconfirmed intelligence, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.12,0:07:53.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First, the Zeons have learned\Nfrom our use of the Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:56.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no need for quantity\Nif the mobile suits are powerful enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.33,0:07:59.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They seem to feel that one or two will be\Nenough to obtain the desired results.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.79,0:08:03.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,G-General! Those diagrams on the monitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.13,0:08:05.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are they all different types of mobile suits?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:11.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I believe so. Furthermore, Zeon is testing\Na new design they call "mobile armor."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.76,0:08:14.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mobile... armor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.39,0:08:16.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This one Gundam has primed the pump.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.89,0:08:18.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Primed the pump?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:22.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy's attacks will become\Neven fiercer. In any case...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.57,0:08:24.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll inform you of any new intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:26.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make sure you consider\Nyour countermeasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.91,0:08:35.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. 2! Once you've released your Goggs,\Nmake a detour to enter from the north!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.87,0:08:39.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you sink the Trojan Horse\Nbefore Captain Char arrives!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:40.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Goggs, ready for launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.81,0:08:57.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Goggs should reach the Trojan Horse\Nin about eight minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.73,0:09:01.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll cover the landing of the Goggs by firing\Nmissiles 30 seconds before they arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.07,0:09:07.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.40,0:09:10.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man. What a hassle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:12.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Soldier! Won't you buy something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.87,0:09:13.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.62,0:09:18.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing in there worth buying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.50,0:09:21.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all locally made. And, delicious too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.00,0:09:24.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're pretty cute!\NThough, it looks like you have a tough life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.25,0:09:25.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then buy something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.34,0:09:26.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.63,0:09:28.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cheapskate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.30,0:09:29.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, buy something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.76,0:09:31.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.34,0:09:33.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That old man is very nice, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.89,0:09:35.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't wanna join, Fraw Bow?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.51,0:09:36.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.89,0:09:38.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good job, soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.97,0:09:41.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we join the military...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.52,0:09:44.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who'll take care of the children?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.86,0:09:46.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're all used to the White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.94,0:09:48.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have a point there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.32,0:09:49.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.90,0:09:52.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not safe for you\Nhere on the dock!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.78,0:09:54.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go play over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.37,0:09:57.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We gotta clean all the White Base's toilets\Nand change the bed covers!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.66,0:09:59.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We got tons of things to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:10:00.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ungrateful brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.96,0:10:03.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It would be cruel to separate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.96,0:10:13.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, Marshy! We're on schedule to reach\Nthe harbor housing the Trojan Horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.72,0:10:14.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.18,0:10:15.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.18,0:10:18.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're awfully small. Could they be...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.10,0:10:24.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! Just as I feared!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.10,0:10:26.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hats off to the Gogg. Not even a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:28.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Releasing Freeze Gel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.33,0:10:41.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've lost response from Area 22.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:42.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please go to alert status.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.12,0:10:47.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our approach looks problem-free.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.13,0:10:49.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain Boone!\NI'm counting on your attack to cover us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.76,0:10:55.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's time... Fire missiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.85,0:11:03.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Missiles detected!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:03.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From Area 22?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.98,0:11:05.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, from 54!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.74,0:11:17.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What should we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.11,0:11:19.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.91,0:11:23.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which of the mobile suits\Nare ready to sortie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.79,0:11:24.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Only the Gundam, sir.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.83,0:11:27.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not Guntank or Guncannon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.46,0:11:30.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The cannon's getting an overhaul.{\i}\N{\i1}The whole thing's sitting in pieces.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.84,0:11:32.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro says he'll launch in the Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.55,0:11:33.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:37.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I heard he can't use the beam rifle.\NPlease check with the mechanics.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.68,0:11:38.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.68,0:11:41.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, you may proceed.\NJust don't damage the dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.51,0:11:43.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, come on. Fraw Bow.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.60,0:11:45.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're beginning to talk like Ms. Sayla.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.27,0:11:48.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh. Really? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.74,0:12:01.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Great. It's all going according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.37,0:12:10.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chief Lasa! Marshy here.\NI'm on shore, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.24,0:12:40.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like mobile suits have landed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.41,0:12:43.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't let them near the dock!\NProtect the White Base no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.50,0:12:51.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you seriously think those vulcans\Nwill penetrate Goggs armor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.59,0:13:04.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that also a new type of mobile suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.89,0:13:06.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks different from the Zakus or Goufs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.39,0:13:10.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, if that thing came from the sea...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.77,0:13:14.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...it might be the Gogg type,\Nwhich was developed to be amphibious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.70,0:13:21.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There you are, mobile suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.70,0:13:28.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,General. It's unsafe out here. The shelter...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.25,0:13:31.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. If it's our time to die,\Nit makes no difference where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.79,0:13:35.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the commander of an army is content\Nto shout orders from the rear...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.54,0:13:37.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...he'll lose even a winning battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.05,0:13:39.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That may be true, sir, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:42.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't we defend against\Nattacks from the right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.26,0:13:45.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir! I'll pass that on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.60,0:13:48.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's happening with our defense line\Nfrom Areas 60 to 65?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.97,0:13:52.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sir! We've just requested{\i}\N{\i1}the Guntank's assistance!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.44,0:13:57.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nowadays, everything always\Ncomes down to mobile suits...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:13:58.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My, how times have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:14:03.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy is right in front of us!\NMove G-Bull to Hatch 3 and send it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.32,0:14:08.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you're saying I shouldn't be\Nin the G-Bull when we send it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.29,0:14:10.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not exactly. But if you stay here for now...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.95,0:14:13.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...we can use the Gundam\Nand G-Fighter later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.50,0:14:16.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A difficult choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.13,0:14:19.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. Our tactics rely too much\Non the Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.00,0:14:21.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay then. I'll take off in the G-Fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.80,0:14:25.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't yet. The main engine still needs\Na bit more work done on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.80,0:14:28.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!\NHurry up, will you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.81,0:14:32.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway... move the G-Fighter to Deck 3\Nso that it's ready for takeoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.68,0:14:33.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.81,0:14:36.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow. Tell Hayato to hurry\Nand head out in the Guntank!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.44,0:14:39.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!\NHayato! Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.11,0:14:40.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Guntank, moving out!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.53,0:14:45.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Guntank, heading out! Open the gate for me!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.99,0:14:53.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are those missiles coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:54.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,White Base! Please provide some info!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.21,0:14:59.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That town...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:06.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's some mobile suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.59,0:15:08.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The vulcan guns don't seem to affect it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:13.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... at that speed...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:23.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How dare you, you Gun... thingamajig!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.49,0:15:34.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Gogg won't lose to your horsepower.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.37,0:15:36.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I can't believe this guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.62,0:15:38.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This hammer's been powered up, but...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.75,0:15:43.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:53.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.39,0:15:56.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? What in the world are you doing\Nstill wandering around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.81,0:15:57.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Run away, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.98,0:16:00.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So sorry. Bye, Mr. Soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.73,0:16:02.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're not soldiers either!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.86,0:16:05.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, Mr. Kai. You'd better hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.53,0:16:07.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! Amuro! Get a move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.66,0:16:14.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If only I had the beam rifle,\NI'd take out this mobile suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.62,0:16:17.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait a second... Fraw Bow!\NCan the G-Parts be used yet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.92,0:16:20.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's see. Yes, they can.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.29,0:16:22.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have them get the G-Bull parts ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.17,0:16:22.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.26,0:16:30.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? He retreated?! That Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.47,0:16:33.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A mobile suit that scares even the Gundam?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.36,0:16:50.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Omur! Please have the Gundam's\NB Parts ready to launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.16,0:16:52.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You never know what'll happen in a battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.62,0:16:53.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm aware of that, Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.62,0:16:57.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ms. Sayla!\NWe're taking off! Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.37,0:16:59.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.72,0:17:12.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's one unusually large tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.23,0:17:21.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:24.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This cockpit is so strong,\Nit can withstand a direct beam blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.57,0:17:31.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.92,0:17:46.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M... Marshy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.42,0:17:48.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.47,0:17:56.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro. The other mobile suit{\i}\N{\i1}just escaped Into the sea.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.10,0:17:57.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.10,0:18:00.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could you check with White Base?\NFind out if the B Parts are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.93,0:18:03.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like you don't need to\Nreturn to the White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.85,0:18:06.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Omur and the others are preparing\Nfor a mid-air transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.94,0:18:09.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to pilot it this time, okay Amuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.61,0:18:12.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, all right...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.20,0:18:16.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop! Okay, continue...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.62,0:18:18.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right! Slower!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:19.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with the elevator?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.45,0:18:21.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The pressure pipe hasn't been fixed yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.54,0:18:29.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Preparations to send out\NG-Armor's B Parts are complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.38,0:18:31.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Open up Central Hatch 3!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.21,0:18:32.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're launching the G-Armor's B Parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.92,0:18:34.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is very strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.89,0:18:37.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When the mobile suit vanished,\Nthe missile bombardment stopped as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.60,0:18:42.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see! The enemy mobile suits emerged\Nfrom the ocean, didn't they? Fraw Bow?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.35,0:18:44.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.15,0:18:48.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please tell Sayla to cover the Gundam with the G-Fighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.87,0:19:03.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Docking searcher synchronized! Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.46,0:19:11.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Control system is switched over!\NGundam, separating!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.63,0:19:15.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger! You need to take extra care\Nwhen pursuing the enemy, Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.80,0:19:16.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.65,0:19:36.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, it's the Gundam!\NIt's dangerous to pursue too far...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.12,0:19:44.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wh... Where is he?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.79,0:19:46.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.92,0:19:49.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You fell for it, Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.61,0:20:18.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One more shot from the beam cannons,\Nand you're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.08,0:20:26.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The monitor! I can't use it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.62,0:20:30.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.17,0:20:32.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.30,0:20:36.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? The monitor's gone out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.32,0:20:57.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh... Who won?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.78,0:21:00.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like the battle's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.07,0:21:04.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! Amuro! Respond!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:06.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gundam! Gundam! Please respond!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.33,0:21:10.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't you hear the radio?\NAmuro! Please... respond!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.63,0:21:14.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.88,0:21:17.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like the Gundam won.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.84,0:21:18.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.55,0:21:21.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the enemy had won,\Nthey'd be attacking again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.93,0:21:25.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course... it's also possible\Nthat they destroyed each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.35,0:21:29.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see something moving underwater!\NI'll send you an image of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.14,0:21:32.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm receiving an image from the G-Fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.15,0:21:38.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Connection...restored...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.36,0:21:42.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can you hear me, White Base... ?\NI'm returning to ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.91,0:21:46.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright! Amuro's on his way back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.54,0:21:47.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.58,0:21:49.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.56,0:22:17.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Captain Char!\NStandby to take in his Sealance!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:26.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow! That's the Captain for you!\NHis skill is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.87,0:22:31.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's it, all right. The Trojan Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.96,0:22:35.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... both Goggs that sent us\Nthis video have been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.75,0:22:37.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's only to be expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.75,0:22:40.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That mobile suit isn't a\Ncheap mass-produced type.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.88,0:22:42.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still... I am ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.01,0:22:45.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's quite all right, Boone...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.97,0:22:50.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't rest until I bring this guy down...\Nwith my own two hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.56,0:22:52.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.48,0:22:54.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know it's childish...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.56,0:23:00.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that is the mobile suit\Nthat injured my pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.42,0:23:19.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Under Char's command...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.04,0:23:22.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...fierce attacks on the White Base continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.13,0:23:26.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kai Shiden's distaste for the military\Nleads him to say good-bye to everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.30,0:23:28.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...but later, he rejoins the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.30,0:23:32.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However... close behind him\Nis a young woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.97,0:23:36.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...\NA Spy on Board.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.44,0:23:40.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
